  "explanation": {
    "md_es": [
      "**some** → frases **afirmativas**: *I've got some bread.*",
      "",
      "**any** → **negativas y preguntas**: *We haven't got any milk. Have we got any bread?*",
      "",
      "Se usan con plurales (*some apples*) y con cosas que no se cuentan (*some milk*).",
      "",
      "**Excepción útil:** en ofrecimientos y pedidos se usa *some*: *Would you like some tea?*",
      "",
      "**Comidas del día:** breakfast · lunch · dinner (*for breakfast* = de desayuno)."
    ],
    "common_mistakes_es": [
      {
        "wrong": "I haven't got some milk.",
        "right": "I haven't got any milk.",
        "note": "En negativas se usa any."
      },
      {
        "wrong": "I've got any bread.",
        "right": "I've got some bread.",
        "note": "En afirmativas se usa some."
      }
    ],
